## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/search_regex_n_navigation`

**/m.** matches any two-character sequence starting with 'm'. Pressing **n** navigates through each match in order.

**Keys:** `/m.\n` then `n` then `n`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0
- Line: `move max moon`

**after_regex_search.png**
- Cursor on first match "mo" at col 0
- All matches highlighted: "mo", "ma", "mo"

**after_first_n.png**
- Cursor on second match "ma" at col 5

**after_second_n.png**
- Cursor on third match "mo" at col 9
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('/m.\n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_regex_search');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('n');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_first_n');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('n');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_second_n');
    },
}
